WEBVTT

00:00:29.579 --> 00:00:32.537
I can promise what you'll hear
will be true to Ted,

00:00:32.537 --> 00:00:36.454
a curated podcast for the curious whether
it's about business, design,

00:00:36.454 --> 00:00:39.704
science or philosophy. If you
can handle the mystery.

00:00:39.704 --> 00:00:42.912
Stick around and to dive into
our entire portfolio,

00:00:42.996 --> 00:00:45.329
head to audio collective Ted Dotcom.

00:00:45.787 --> 00:00:47.371
I'd love to know which episode you get,

00:00:47.537 --> 00:00:53.246
tweet at us or email podcasts at Ted
Dotcom. We promise we read every message.